WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
NIST SP 800-53 is one of the most influential cybersecurity control catalogs in the world.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.955
It provides organizations with a structured collection of security and privacy controls

00:00:09.955 --> 00:00:11.300
that support risk management,

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.190
compliance, governance, engineering, and operational security activities.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:19.000
Through control families, baselines, and risk-based implementation approaches,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
NIST SP 800-53 helps organizations build and maintain effective security programs.
